  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2019-01-09T00:20:50.048Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "So, I have absolutely garbage internet. I get disconnected randomly, sometimes multiple times back to back in small periods of time and its extremely annoying to have to acknowledge the fact ingame. \n\n\"VRChat has lost connection\"\n\"VRChat has disconnected\"\n\"VRChat has lost internet connection\"\n\n[Okay]\n\nI know I've been disconnected, but in order to join back to my world you have to press the [OKay] button each time. Sometimes thanks to fullbody, that Okay button is directly behind me or underneath me, so Im stuck lost looking for this screen to press just to join back.\n\nCould we have a setting to Auto -skip this [Okay] button to load back into a world? Like when joining a world?",
